<title>INDONESIA: Surya Dumai 1996 net up to 44.09 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Surya Dumai 1996 net up to 44.09 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    44.09 vs  28.00</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)     124   vs  89</p>
<p>    Net sales			   332.94  vs 283.87</p>
<p>    Gross profit			100.16  vs  75.98</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   65.31  vs  50.03</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     56.68  vs  35.55</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		  98.26  vs  54.17</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were audited. PT Surya Dumai Industri is an integrated timber company.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
